# The plaintext device binary is never committed: it is ZTE's, and a private
# repo can be made public by accident. Only the encrypted form goes in.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!*.enc

# Note: this catch-all is also what keeps icg_blob_key (the decryption key for
# the .enc above) out of git. The root .gitignore ignores that name explicitly
# as well. Do NOT add an exception that could match it.
